				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>Join the Discord</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/369a8c6eae3d56ffdb351a4a00c33d07.avif?t=1793095492" width=780 height=200 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/f4ddb2bdfdb3509214ba87943c87ef4d.avif?t=1793095492" width=780 height=350 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.poster.avif?t=1793095492" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.webm?t=1793095492" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/b2cdececfe044281349766daacbf66a0.mp4?t=1793095492" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>TRADE</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Buy, sell, short stocks online. In full screen or placed in the corner of your desktop while you take care of other things.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>BUY STOCKS</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Various stocks are available for you to make your gains (or losses). Gain access to new stocks along the way and find those best suit your strategy.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Buy more stocks, receive more from dividends, increase your base income. Level up to gain bonuses such as auto-actions and higher offline returns.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Online multiplayer clicker stock trader</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Level up to unlock new stocks and abilities</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Upgrade your income, dividends, and stock volume</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Prestige by Going Public</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Can be played in full screen or in the corner of your dekstop</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Tons of skins</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.poster.avif?t=1793095492" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.webm?t=1793095492" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356780/extras/519db4c4e34f92013578347e40684ab3.mp4?t=1793095492" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
